    <description>After a team member&apos;s ips_Manager_Id__c changes: synchronously syncs the value to other ips_Team_Member__c records sharing the same ips_User__c, then asynchronously (after commit) re-reads the most recently modified team member for that user and updates User.ManagerId only when the authoritative manager value is non-blank and differs from the current value. Clearing the manager only updates team members; User.ManagerId is retained. Red zone: verify recursion stop (fan-out runs once) and last-write-wins behaviour under concurrent updates before relying on this in production.</description>
